This is exactly why we get looked down upon. Damn it.

51
00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.940
So annoying.

52
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.110
Hey.

53
00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.039
What's so great about you?

54
00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.759
- Ji-woo. - You've been pulling a long face this whole time.

55
00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:35.819
Are you asking because you really don't know?

56
00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.489
Yeah, I have absolutely no idea.

57
00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:38.969
What exactly are people like you

58
00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.669
