86
00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.749
F***, how can this kid be so stupid?

87
00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.359
Hey, just tell your mom you bought a watch.

88
00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.679
Don't you need a watch when you study? Right?

89
00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.069
