90
00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.570
Always asking me... ugh.

91
00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.739
Oh, that must have hurt like hell.

92
00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.049
Wow, Manil High School.

93
00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.989
A bunch of pathetic losers, f***.

94
00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.669
Of all places, it was built right next to our Manyik High School.

95
00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.940
They have no choice but to obediently hand over their money. F***.

96
00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.529
Go report us then, punk.

97
00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.619
On my way to prison,

98
00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.429
