103
00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.709
Whether you call your parents or whatever,
get the card restored.

104
00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.190
F***ing silver spoon.

105
00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.139
Hey, I'm going to take a dump and come right back.

106
00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:54.499
- Let's take off this kid's pants and film a video. - Damn it.

107
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.990
What color is Jun-min's underwear today?

108
00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.940
Hey, hey, wait a minute.

109
00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.030
