110
00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.699
Is that school over there a different one?

111
00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.859
It's just another school belonging to the same foundation.

112
00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.899
The reason Jun-min isn't here right now

113
00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.879
