117
00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:20.680
Last month, someone actually did report them.

118
00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:27.339
It's true they were sent to the juvenile detention center.

119
00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.800
But that person's dad is still unconscious to this day.

120
00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.509
