123
00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.150
So that's how it is.

124
00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.810
Why of all places did it have to be next to Manyik High School? Damn it.

125
00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.219
- What? Manyik High School? - What? Manyik High School?

126
00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.090
(Manyik High School)

127
00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.750
Wow.

128
00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:57.940
