132
00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.000
Prestigious high schools really are different.

133
00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.300
Hey, over there.

134
00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.759
Wow, our wallets are about to get fat, right?

135
00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.269
Excuse me.

136
00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.769
Do you know where the study group exchange meeting is held here?

137
00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.340
