140
00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.359
'Meteor Vocational High School in Ancheon'.

141
00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.460
Where is that?

142
00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.190
Hey.

143
00:07:52.191 --> 00:07:54.929
Isn't Meteor Vocational High School that f***ing number one in Ancheon?

144
00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:56.769
Ah, that Meteor?

145
00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:57.480
What the hell.

146
00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:00.810
Is Eom Seok-dae planning to form an alliance with Ancheon, is that why they're invited?

147
00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.039
